{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "27adf8ef14ae13a21e576a4cd08c466e16eaa890d3abc5e2b1307ac3f8da9386", "ja": "囲碁将棋センターにいる志希と美也を見つけ\n出したエレナとフレデリカ。周囲が騒ぎにな\nってしまうが、おかげでプロデューサーも合\n流。生放送番組も、その場からネット中継で\n撮影する事になり、結果は大成功。", "zh": "艾莲娜和芙蕾德莉卡找到了身处\n围棋将棋中心的志希与美也。\n虽然周围引发了一阵骚动，但托此\n之福，制作人也与她们汇合。\n直播节目也改为在现场通过网络直播\n进行拍摄，结果大获成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1000_null", "source_sha256": "e16593307a1b40bb228ba0c88be97cb6e57652d3ccc763bbc173a8b0468dd300", "ja": "囲碁将棋センター……", "zh": "围棋将棋中心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1001_205xxx", "source_sha256": "89157bba4cd6b0ae3fa8ce1554b49333d58584c24beea67ded51a42897555a3c", "ja": "ふぅ～……ちょっと休憩！\n美也ちゃん、言うだけあって強いね～。", "zh": "呼——……稍微休息一下！\n美也果然很强呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "1512f2addc43b1ccd91cbbe79fb8118eb3241b7debd98e7640d849d788a15b1c", "ja": "ふふふ～。でも志希さんも、とてもいい打ち筋を\nしてますね～。本当に初めてなんですか～？", "zh": "呵呵呵～不过志希小姐的下棋路数也很不错呢～真的是第一次下吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1003_205xxx", "source_sha256": "049cb0b9e57533583903446b44418fc2ff2132cd8db84e9cd57281518eb75ebd", "ja": "まーねー。今までキョーミなかったし。\nでもやってみると、意外と熱くなるね。", "zh": "是啊～毕竟之前完全没兴趣嘛。\n不过试着玩了玩，意外地还挺上头的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1004_042miy", "source_sha256": "a2cb20d8f6104fb235efe3944064cbeb62f828d84d4cc89035146559c3ca4f83", "ja": "お～、それは嬉しいですな～。\n連れてきた甲斐がありましたよ～♪", "zh": "哦～那可真让人高兴呀～。\n看来带你来这里是值得的呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1005_se", "source_sha256": "da3fb9d37a3c5533f88258c00fb9fc40d904f2d400d34aead3e63b1039f63550", "ja": "ザワザワ、ガヤガヤ……", "zh": "嘈杂、喧闹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1006_205xxx", "source_sha256": "4b381fc1a38ffd7e292ab12a52520c3cd2cb784198c43bd39239ffbed76d90ea", "ja": "おやおや～？　なんだか外が騒がしいね。\nお祭りでも始まるのかな～？", "zh": "哎呀呀～？外面好像有点吵闹呢。\n难道要开始什么祭典了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1007_se", "source_sha256": "e107f9fe4322ec4dca95a68205eb6393ff99420317b420bc97aaceea854dde00", "ja": "ダダダダ……ウィーン。", "zh": "哒哒哒哒……嗡——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "3e458b4992aaddb45378616e9afcabe6b1d2551fd4e4ec07ccaf279313d0aac9", "ja": "えっと……あ、いたーっ！　ミヤ、シキ！\nフレデリカー、ふたりがいたヨー！", "zh": "那个……啊，找到了——！美也、志希！\n芙蕾德莉卡——，找到你们两个啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1009_204xxx", "source_sha256": "7acdfa5e084cf9a68e8176aad5180677c6adc58aa84be26cc1a7af4ad80cd8df", "ja": "ワオ！　本当に見つけちゃった！\nエレナちゃんスゴイね！　もしかして、これって運命？", "zh": "哇！真的被我们找到了！\n艾莲娜好厉害！难道说，这就是命运？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "6b34ef0c1b5c64d0d38450fea4d71b8487e7fc93f1a012a59cc88f281ee9475c", "ja": "エレナさん、フレデリカさん～♪\nお待ちしてました～。", "zh": "艾丽娜、芙蕾德莉卡～♪\n等你们好久啦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1011_205xxx", "source_sha256": "908594a3e63f73c9fc2078805e9865352bd000ba957c444f0ab49de6250ff954", "ja": "やっほー、ふたりとも。交代したかったところだよー。\nって、劇場の{$P$}は？", "zh": "呀吼～，你们两个。正好想跟你们换班呢～。\n话说，剧场的{$P$}呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1012_018ele", "source_sha256": "6c07d7f50f1ab6837c1e1d8d3c732484f564d094794a03a5c5f2bcbecd7b7a50", "ja": "ウン……ふたりのことが心配で、\nワタシ達だけ、飛び出してきちゃったノ！", "zh": "嗯……因为担心你们两个，\n所以我们就擅自跑出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "6a364eac80d7a7b65b224055fc04fcdaf686dd94b542c5cdbe0061260ca37091", "ja": "もう、ミヤー！　勝手にいなくならないでヨ～！\nすっごく心配したんだからネッ！", "zh": "真是的，美也——！不要擅自跑掉啦～！\n我可是担心死了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1014_042miy", "source_sha256": "67168a235e3839b948b1cf03275b4715562213741665b3e66579b5272de7365a", "ja": "すみません、エレナさん～。\nでも来てくれて、とっても嬉しいです～。", "zh": "对不起，艾蕾娜～  \n不过你能来，我真的特别开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1015_205xxx", "source_sha256": "8034fcefb85c0d06f7c784817e1979bd59f15bc1b8b42ec94c68d2af2287fed2", "ja": "ん～。やっぱり見つけられちゃった。\nじゃあ、今日はおとなしく戻るとしよっかー。", "zh": "嗯～果然还是被发现了。那今天就乖乖回去吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1016_018ele", "source_sha256": "0888b6968093599f728df1a0d8dff1947d5c7210e86fa9294a8cb88872e0deff", "ja": "じゃあ{$P$}に連絡を……。\nワオ！？　履歴がすっごいイッパイ～！", "zh": "那么就联系{$P$}……  \n哇哦！？记录也太多了吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1017_204xxx", "source_sha256": "2ff743b53f9c2db49fde54b90f3b97425edb0065150c645b7841f6564526ee63", "ja": "ひゅーひゅー、熱烈なラブコールだね♪\nフレちゃん、ちょっと妬けちゃうな～。", "zh": "哇哦哇哦，真是热烈的爱之呼唤呢♪  \n芙蕾都有点吃醋了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "9c844587bab498ee3fbafd64d097ac85a0bc9065e20d17f66a912bec3c4e9af6", "ja": "そんなこと言ってる場合じゃないヨー！\n早く返事しないと……。", "zh": "现在可不是说这种话的时候啦——！\n得赶紧回复才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "9f5f724027e4b2b1dedbc55a33ad2ac5c18ac4c9fa341790cf56c7a50c69177d", "ja": "その必要はないぞ！　ハァハァ、ハァ……！", "zh": "没那个必要！哈啊哈啊，哈啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1020_018ele", "source_sha256": "f29267921551928681799750b610daccbdce1aa8cb0addc1f8944a17646938b1", "ja": "エッ、{$P$}！？\nどうしてここにいるってわかったノ！？", "zh": "咦，{$P$}！？\n你怎么知道我在这里的呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1021_p", "source_sha256": "41963eb25c6c1ddfa662ee2930739faba63044f74d9974b324e2c325b39510fc", "ja": "そりゃわかるよ……ハァハァ。\nこの通り、すごい騒ぎになってるからな……。", "zh": "那当然看得出来啊……呼、呼。\n你看，这里已经闹得不可开交了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1022_se", "source_sha256": "da3fb9d37a3c5533f88258c00fb9fc40d904f2d400d34aead3e63b1039f63550", "ja": "ザワザワ、ガヤガヤ……", "zh": "嘈杂、喧闹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1023_205xxx", "source_sha256": "c375921031bce5b1120944370082680d809b05de89a6f61cea47966d23277bd0", "ja": "そっか、あたし達が衣装でブラブラしてたから？\nうんうん、これはエレガントな証明だね～♪", "zh": "这样啊，是因为我们穿着演出服到处晃悠吗？\n嗯嗯，这可是优雅的证明呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "1c14c377961c22cc5223e7eecc95a2151bc7296c7fed9c5048986684c9fbe0a5", "ja": "SNSでも話題になってたから、わかったんだ。\nふぅ……まあとにかく、無事でよかった。", "zh": "在社交媒体上也引起了话题，我才找过来的。\n呼……不过总之，人没事就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1025_205xxx", "source_sha256": "4c9d79212eee01da86c6b69caf0d0dcdf50c0fc7202b3230d37e6a1174d78b52", "ja": "よかったよかった！　でも、怒らないんだ。\nそれって、あたし達がゲストのお客さんだから？", "zh": "太好了太好了！不过，你不生气吗？\n是因为我们是受邀的客人吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "f4021b793e8add8a4b658f7e7274e5f8643e40ca5d0d5bfb72dd27738b037b5a", "ja": "どうかな。怒るべきかもしれないけど、君は自分の\nしていること、理解した上でやってるみたいだし。", "zh": "很难说。也许我应该生气，但你似乎是在理解自己所做的事情后才这么做的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1027_p", "source_sha256": "37caf01aedd4f3e5c6c1d9201ab4e7608609ae4b868f182acc8362b30f4bcacb", "ja": "だったら、そんな君をどう生かすかが、\nこっちの考えることだと思う。それに……。", "zh": "既然如此，接下来该考虑的，就是如何让这样的你发挥作用。而且……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "4c2acaa9207b1e05d6898aee26bd2a7b385ce197280d8ee462afae79961c3d04", "ja": "怒るというか、必要なときに君を叱るべき人は、\n君の事務所にいるはずだからね。", "zh": "与其说是生气，不如说，该在必要的时候训斥你的人，应该就在你的事务所里吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1029_205xxx", "source_sha256": "8ddcfc8f7da8709806e755536d9d935baf3858c1d189a32acd53446401bf05e1", "ja": "……あはは！　キミも面白いねー♪\nそんなこと言う人、なかなかいないよ。", "zh": "……啊哈哈！你也很有意思呢～♪\n会说这种话的人，可不多见哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "83c3745111e3ec49c92fdb553888d98cbcdda3b598386c126d6a6e16c596084c", "ja": "あ……あのネ、{$P$}……。\nもうすぐ撮影、始まる時間だよネ……？", "zh": "啊……那个，{$P$}……\n马上就要到开始拍摄的时间了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1031_018ele", "source_sha256": "e91184d8c343a31a170c7bc54d7e7ca54d3cff66c6a86f452209388538c0fb47", "ja": "もしかして、収録……。\n無くなっちゃったのかナ～？", "zh": "难道说，录制……  \n取消了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1032_204xxx", "source_sha256": "c7da4ed36b93f2fe70b6e2d7b19a8db3c642d484f1ae5b72d911c9f77aea3e5f", "ja": "ワオ、もうこんな時間～！？　スタジオまで\n間に合わないよね？　どうするどうする～？", "zh": "哇，已经这么晚了～！？赶不到摄影棚了吧？怎么办怎么办～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0160_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0160_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "ee5e4d77bd5f6d2f8951b39414f035e217a546d979fad4cd8f64917f0c11a0df", "ja": "大丈夫。今から撮影を始めるから。\nみんな、スタンバイしてくれ。", "zh": "没问题。马上就要开始拍摄了。\n大家，做好准备吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
